   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Timor-Leste Trade Governance Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Apoiar o Governo de Timor-Leste (GTL) na institucionaliza&#xe7;&#xe3;o de um sistema comercial moderno e bem governado que seja profissional, transparente, respons&#xe1;vel, eficiente, eficaz e que responda &#xe0;s necessidades.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the Government of Timor-Leste (GOTL) to institutionalize a well-governed and modern trade system that is professional, transparent, accountable, efficient, effective, and responsive to needs.</narrative>
